    "data" : "190.140 Citation of KRS 190.090 to 190.140.\nKRS 190.090 to 190.140 may be cited as \"The Motor Vehicle Retail Installment Sales\nAct.\"\nEffective: July 1, 1956\nHistory: Created 1956 Ky. Acts ch. 105, sec. 8, effective July 1, 1956.",
