    "data" : "257.350 Reports of sales -- Liability of seller on guarantees.\nWithin three (3) days after the sale, the person who conducted the sale shall submit a\nstatement to the Office of State Veterinarian giving a complete list of the number and\nkind of baby chicks or poults sold, name and address of each purchaser, together with a\ncopy of representation and guarantee made in relation to the sale, if any were made by the\nperson who conducted the sale, and the person conducting the sale shall be held to have\nhad full knowledge of the representations and guarantees made at the time of the sale and\nshall be as fully responsible and liable for any representation and guarantee as is the\nperson who set forth the representation and guarantee on the containers as provided in\nKRS 257.340.\nEffective: June 29, 2023\nHistory: Amended 2023 Ky. Acts ch. 16, sec. 3, effective June 29, 2023. -- Amended\n2002 Ky. Acts ch. 49, sec. 8, effective July 15, 2002. -- Created 1946 Ky. Acts ch.\n103, sec. 4.",
