    "UOR" : "'04076'",
    "data" : "261.280 Fraudulent manipulation of scales prohibited.\nIt shall be unlawful for any weighman to misweigh or falsely report any weights or to\notherwise fraudulently manipulate scales to produce a weight other than the true and\nactual weight of any livestock consigned to and sold at any stockyard or buying station.\nEffective: July 12, 2012\nHistory: Amended 2012 Ky. Acts ch. 28, sec. 7, effective July 12, 2012. -- Amended\n2006 Ky. Acts ch. 225, sec. 7, effective July 12, 2006. -- Created 1954 Ky. Acts ch.\n130, sec. 9, effective June 17, 1954."
