    "data" : "281A.060 License limitation.\nNo person who drives a commercial motor vehicle may have more than one (1) driver's\nlicense.\nEffective: July 13, 1990\nHistory: Created 1990 Ky. Acts ch. 455, sec. 6, effective July 13, 1990.",
