    "data" : "150.416 Fur processor -- Receipts and inventory.\nEvery licensed fur processor shall, within fifteen (15) days after January 1 and July 1 of\neach year file with the department an inventory of furs in his possession as of such dates.\nEvery licensed fur processor shall also issue receipts for the total number of furs\npurchased from fur buyers, each of which shall show the license number of the fur buyer\nfrom whom purchased. Duplicates of such receipts shall be sent to the department with\nthe inventory report.\nEffective: June 19, 1952\nHistory: Amended 1952 Ky. Acts ch. 200, sec. 59, effective June 19, 1952. -- Created\n1946 Ky. Acts ch. 84, sec. 21."
