 the tax\ndetermined to be due by the department at the time the owner titled or\nregistered the vehicle.\nEffective: June 24, 2015\nHistory: Amended 2015 Ky. Acts ch. 67, sec. 9, effective June 24, 2015. -- Amended\n2009 (1st Extra. Sess.) Ky. Acts ch. 1, sec. 113, effective September 1, 2009. --\nAmended 2006 Ky. Acts ch. 6, sec. 9, effective March 6, 2006; ch. 251, sec. 4,\neffective July 12, 2006; and ch. 252, Pt. XXXV, sec. 2, effective January 1, 2007. --\nAmended 2005 Ky. Acts ch. 85, sec. 386, effective June 20, 2005; and ch. 173, Pt.\nXIV, sec. 1, effective March 20, 2005. -- Amended 1998 Ky. Acts ch. 600, sec. 4,\neffective April 14, 1998. -- Amended 1994 Ky. Acts ch. 54, sec. 3, effective July 15,\n1994; and ch. 65, sec. 15, effective July 15, 1994. -- Amended 1990 Ky. Acts ch.\n476, Pt. VII B, sec. 626, effective July 1, 1990. -- Amended 1986 Ky. Acts ch. 496,\nsec. 18, effective August 1, 1986. -- Amended 1984 Ky. Acts ch. 409, sec. 1,\neffective July 13, 1984. -- Amended 1982 Ky. Acts ch. 375, sec. 2, effective July 15,\n1982. -- Amended 1978 Ky. Acts ch. 10, sec. 1, effective June 17, 1978; and ch. 384,\nsec. 283, effective June 17, 1978. -- Amended 1976 Ky. Acts ch. 89, sec. 2; ch. 133,\nsec. 1; ch. 155, sec. 3; and ch. 349, sec. 2, effective July 1, 1976. -- Amended 1974\nKy. Acts ch. 325, sec. 1. -- Amended 1972 Ky. Acts ch. 84, Pt. IV, sec. 2. --\nAmended 1968 Ky. Acts ch. 40, Part III, sec. 2. -- Amended 1960 Ky. Acts ch. 186,\nArt. IV, sec. 3. -- Recodified 1942 Ky. Acts ch. 208, sec. 1, effective October 1,\n1942, from Ky. Stat. sec. 4281i-2, 4281i-4, 4281i-5.\nLegislative Research Commission Note (1\/1\/2007). This section was amended by 2006\nKy. Acts chs. 6, 251, and 252. Where these Acts are not in conflict, they have been\ncodified together. Where a conflict exists between Acts ch. 6 and chs. 251 and 252,\nActs chs. 251 and 252, which were enacted by the General Assembly after Acts ch.\n6, prevail under KRS 446.250.\nLegislative Research C