    "data" : "528.030 Promoting gambling in the second degree.\n(1) A person is guilty of promoting gambling in the second degree when he knowingly\nadvances or profits from unlawful gambling activity.\n(2) Promoting gambling in the second degree is a Class A misdemeanor.\nEffective: January 1, 1975\nHistory: Created 1974 Ky. Acts ch. 406, sec. 242, effective January 1, 1975."
