    "data" : "237.126 Misrepresentation of having conducted training courses.\n(1) A firearms instructor trainer or certified firearms instructor is guilty of not\nproviding firearms training if he or she represents to the department that he or she\nhas conducted training for a student firearms instructor or for an applicant in an\napplicant training course and has not, in fact, provided any such training.\n(2) Not providing firearms training is a Class D felony.\nEffective: July 15, 2002\nHistory: Created 2002 Ky. Acts ch. 368, sec. 6, effective July 15, 2002."
