    "data" : "211.972 License and bonding required.\nNo person shall engage in the business of servicing or maintaining sewage pretreatment\nunits, grease traps, or holding tanks, or the transporting of sewage sludge from those\nfacilities within the Commonwealth of Kentucky without being licensed and bonded as\nhereinafter provided.\nEffective: July 14, 1992\nHistory: Amended 1992 Ky. Acts ch. 248, sec. 4, effective July 14, 1992. -- Created\n1968 Ky. Acts ch. 82, sec. 2.\nFormerly codified as KRS 224.223."
