ners shall not\npractice athletic training while under inactive status. Inactive athletic trainers may\napply for an active license after paying a fee as prescribed in administrative\nregulations promulgated by the board.\n(6) Persons who are certified by the board and are in good standing as athletic trainers\non July 12, 2006, shall be automatically licensed under KRS 311.900 to 311.928\nwithout meeting the requirements of subsection (1) of this section.\nEffective: June 25, 2013\nHistory: Amended 2013 Ky. Acts ch. 30, sec. 4, effective June 25, 2013. -- Created\n2006 Ky. Acts ch. 248, sec. 4, effective July 12, 2006.",
