bution established by KRS 121.150 in any one (1) election to\na slate of candidates for Governor and Lieutenant Governor that is elected to office\nas provided by this subsection.\nEffective: March 16, 2005\nHistory: Amended 2005 Ky. Acts ch. 105, sec. 3, effective March 16, 2005. --\nAmended 1992 Ky. Acts ch. 288, sec. 24, effective July 14, 1992. -- Created 1988\nKy. Acts ch. 118, sec. 1, effective 1991.",
