    "data" : "421.080 Evading process prohibited.\n(1) No person shall leave this state or avoid service of process by any means whatever,\nso as to avoid being compelled to testify before any legislative committee or grand\njury.\n(2) No person shall procure the absence of a witness for the purpose set out in\nsubsection (1).\nEffective: October 1, 1942\nHistory: Recodified 1942 Ky. Acts ch. 208, sec. 1, effective October 1, 1942, from Ky.\nStat. secs. 4866a-1, 4866a-2."
