.\nActs ch. 39, sec. 1, effective March 29, 2022. -- Amended 2021 Ky. Acts ch. 13, sec\n15, effective March 12, 2021; and ch. 136, sec. 1, effective June 29, 2021. --\nAmended 2020 Ky. Acts ch. 80, sec. 4, effective July 15, 2020; and ch. 102, sec. 20,\neffective July 15, 2020. -- Amended 2017 Ky. Acts ch. 59, sec. 1, effective January\n1, 2018; and ch. 62, sec. 1, effective June 29, 2017. -- Amended 2016 Ky. Acts ch.\n80, sec. 1, effective July 15, 2016. -- Amended 2014 Ky. Acts ch. 20, sec. 1,\neffective July 15, 2014; and ch. 22, sec. 1, effective July 15, 2014. -- Amended 2013\nKy. Acts ch. 121, sec. 1, effective June 25, 2013. -- Amended 2012 Ky. Acts ch. 125,\nsec. 1, effective July 12, 2012. -- Amended 2010 Ky. Acts ch. 24, sec. 549, effective\nJuly 15, 2010.-- Amended 2008 Ky. Acts ch. 28, sec. 2, effective July 15, 2008. --\nAmended 2007 Ky. Acts ch. 99, sec. 1, effective June 26, 2007. -- Amended 2006\nKy. Acts ch. 179, sec. 6, effective January 1, 2007. -- Amended 2005 Ky. Acts ch.\n85, sec. 645, effective June 20, 2005. -- Amended 2004 Ky. Acts ch. 20, sec. 2,\neffective July 13, 2004. -- Amended 2000 Ky. Acts ch. 435, sec. 1, effective July 14,\n2000. -- Amended 1998 Ky. Acts ch. 121, sec. 1, effective July 15, 1998; and ch.\n474, sec. 1, effective July 15, 1998. -- Amended 1996 Ky. Acts ch. 44, sec. 2,\neffective July 15, 1996. -- Amended 1976 Ky. Acts ch. 381, sec. 6. -- Amended 1970\nKy. Acts ch. 94, sec. 1. -- Amended 1944 Ky. Acts ch. 154, secs. 1, 2 and 3. --\nRecodified 1942 Ky. Acts ch. 208, sec. 1, effective October 1, 1942, from Ky. Stat.\nsec. 2554b-98.\nLegislative Research Commission Note (7\/1\/2025). This statute was amended by 2025\nKy. Acts chs. 82 and 98, which are identical and have been codified together."
